        quotation: From 1962 on, after his first visit in Iwama, he decides to follow the teaching of O'Sensei and of his assistant, Morihiro Saito Sensei (...) In 1968, he becomes Morihiro Saito's Uchideshi and is rapidly adopted by the Master's family (...) Tomita Sensei practiced for about 7 years at the Iwama Dojo. Those years were for him formativeyears dedicated to education and to discovering the way of Budo.
